abstract: >-
  SUMO network and signal plan of the Prybuzka-Svobody intersection (Khmelnytskyi, Ukraine), 5-min
  turning-movement counts from urban video, all demand route files with SHA-256 lists (training, held-out,
  validation, pre-registered locked test, scenarios, perception-error variants, a second real window), the code
  of the demand generation, deep reinforcement learning runs, baselines and analyses, the RESCO modifications as
  patches, the trained models, episode-level results, the pre-registration with its deviation log, and the
  pseudonymised event log of the first annotator's blind hand counts and the tracking review. SUMO 1.26.0.
